      <Desc>COASTAL CHRISTIAN ACADEMY IS A MEMBER OF THE ACSI AND ALSO WASC. OUR SCHOOL YEAR IS FROM SEPTEMBER THROUGH JUNE FOR GRADES K-12TH. OUR GOAL IS TO GIVE CHILDREN A QUALITY EDUCATION WITH AN EMPHASIS ON INSTILLING SPIRITUAL VALUES THAT ARE GROUNDED UPON BIBLICAL TEACHING. OUR CHRISTIAN CURRICULUM INCLUDES BIBLE, MATH, ENGLISH, HISTORY, SCIENCE, P.E. AND OTHER ESSENTIAL CLASSES THAT WILL ENSURE CHILDREN RECEIVE A WELL-ROUNDED EDUCATION. MOST OF OUR CLASSES USE THE BOB JONES CURRICULUM. OUR STAFF IS FULLY QUALIFIED ACCORDING TO THE EDUCATIONAL REQUIREMENTS OF THE STATE LICENSING DEPARTMENT. WE STRIVE TO PROVIDE FAMILIES WITH A GREAT EDUCATIONAL EXPERIENCE. WE WORK AS A TEAM TO ENSURE CHILDREN ARE SPIRITUALLY, PHYSICALLY, ACADEMICALLY, AND SOCIALLY PREPARED FOR A SUCCESSFUL FUTURE.</Desc>
